@startuml
[*] --> Ready to Summarize
Ready to Summarize --> Processing Document : User inputs document
Processing Document --> Document Too Long : Document exceeds 500 words
Document Too Long --> [*] : Alert user and exit
Processing Document --> Extracting Main Points : Document within limit
Extracting Main Points --> Poor Summary Quality : Quality check fails
Poor Summary Quality --> [*] : Suggest improvements and exit
Extracting Main Points --> Generating Summary : Quality check passes
Generating Summary --> Summary Not Relevant : Relevance check fails
Summary Not Relevant --> [*] : Request more context and exit
Generating Summary --> Providing Feedback : Relevance check passes
Providing Feedback --> [*] : User reviews summary
Providing Feedback --> Ready to Summarize : User requests re-analysis
@enduml
